================================================================================
DATA ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

Nutrition Database (sports_nutrition_db.json):
  Contains 284 product entries from Open Food Facts
  (https://world.openfoodfacts.org/) licensed under the
  Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

  Derivative databases must share under the same ODbL 1.0 terms.
  Brand names (Maurten, SiS, GU, etc.) are trademarks of respective owners,
  used nominatively for product identification only.

Virtual Routes (courses/virtual/):
  Procedurally generated using Perlin-style noise with deterministic seeds.
  No third-party route data used.
  Licensed under Apache-2.0 as part of this project.
  Regeneration: python3 generate_procedural_routes.py

Real-World Routes (courses/alps/, pyrenees/, dolomites/, etc.):
  Route names reference real geographic features, which are public-domain
  facts. Gradient profiles represent real elevation data; where provenance
  allows, attribution to source DEM or OpenStreetMap contributors applies
  under ODbL 1.0.

Workouts (workouts/*.zwo):
  Interval structures are based on public-domain exercise physiology patterns
  (Helgerud 2007, Ronnestad 30/15, Billat 30/30, Seiler zones, Coggan power
  profiles). Names and descriptions are original works generated
  programmatically from interval structure; licensed under Apache-2.0.

